<title>JAPAN: Urban Corp corrects 96/97 group current profit.</title>
<headline>Urban Corp corrects 96/97 group current profit.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Urban Corp on Friday corrected its group current profit for the last business year to 507 million yen from the figure of 493 million yen announced on June 2.</p>
<p>The corrected figures show that profits for the year to March 1997 were down 4.4 percent from actual profits the year before, the developer of condominiums said in a statement, citing accounting changes for the revision.</p>
</text>
